msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Oh, thank goodness!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫You were out so good I was scared you might "
"be dead for a minute!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫아아, ⟪k:5⟫다행이네! ⟪k:6⟫꼭 죽은 것처럼 자고 있지 뭐야. ⟪k:7⟫간이 철렁했"
"어."

