msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫(그 말은 ⟪k:2⟫내가 눈을 감으면 ⟪k:3⟫아무 빛도 없단 거지……)"

#: scenario8:scenario8_F7488AA8_4EDB_4346_A046_3EBA43BC2A41
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d34704d1cb344efac115cf9354c83f1d45eea0e840953df99b23c682ef012500
