msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You won’t have the energy to do anything if you don’t keep yourself well rested "
"and nourished."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫잠 푹 자고 ⟪k:3⟫든든히 먹어야 ⟪k:4⟫몸이 남아나요."

#: scenario8:scenario8_2F3F51A3_D154_4F08_8CAB_04A82112DF8F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 74d8c3d9c679144645fc83e2f7ed6a6f4dc29e09bf0bfe99aa70139c24351ab7
