msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫내가 간 곳은 ⟪k:4⟫생전에 거실로 쓰던 난로가 있는 방이었다. ⟪k:5⟫그 중심에 놓"
"인 큰 탁자 위에 ⟪k:6⟫포도주가 진열되어 있었다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_781D2988_007B_4129_8E5B_D73C73D5793B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 27f5699734aee3906415d4b5120e4d8b7b1f63a1994cbbea79dc64993dba9427
#. default-sha256: 0cd7fe84d0c5e13af6b83190ac236c3e3fda58a15e2c10f3581da71bd19b486a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_781D2988_007B_4129_8E5B_D73C73D5793B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The majority of people in the room look poor, like they genuinely need the assistance, but "
"there are a handful of those who look more than well off."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫역시 ⟪k:1⟫일용할 양식이 궁한 자들이 많았는데, ⟪k:2⟫개중에는 그렇지 않아 보이는 자도 있었다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5FBA3FAD_9898_4571_B9AF_DEA3F9A071C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b08b8d8d12fa75517e613fe104607d75aa14a250bd80bfea59e628d688f4bc35
