msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5FBA3FAD_9898_4571_B9AF_DEA3F9A071C1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫They don’t seem to be for want of supplies at the moment, though. ⟪k:3⟫I assume "
"that’s thanks to the lord’s patronage."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫지금은…… ⟪k:3⟫비축이 부족한 분위기는 아닌 것 같네요.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫……영주의 후원 덕분일"
"까요."

#: scenario8:scenario8_4BC57774_1CF9_46D4_B960_2378768987EC
